From dc00d689ffbba6ee0abc156271dce55aea396641 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rename Bot <dev@example.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 15:21:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Rename BOSS agent role to manager agent

Renames all code identifiers, functions, types, filenames, i18n keys/values,
and build scripts referencing the 'BOSS' role to 'manager' terminology:

- bossId/isBoss/bossName/bossProvider/etc -> managerId/isManager/managerName/...
- src/shared/bossIdentity.ts -> src/shared/managerIdentity.ts
- src/renderer/src/hooks/useResolvedBossName.ts -> useResolvedManagerName.ts
- src/renderer/src/i18n/useBossNameSync.ts -> useManagerNameSync.ts
- landing-remotion/src/HowBossHive.tsx -> HowManagerHive.tsx
- 'orchestrator (boss)' role label -> 'manager agent'
- {{bossName}} i18n interpolation -> {{managerName}} across en/zh-CN/ar locales
- landing-remotion build scripts (render:bosshive:*) -> render:managerhive:*

typecheck:node and typecheck:web both pass clean after the rename.
